@startuml
title ATM Control - Validate PIN and Process Requests

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN
WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForCustomerChoice : Valid PIN / Display Menu
WaitingForCustomerChoice --> ProcessingWithdrawal : Withdrawal Selected / Request Withdrawal, Display Wait
ProcessingWithdrawal --> Dispensing : Withdrawal Approved / Dispense Cash, Update Status
Dispensing --> Printing : Cash Dispensed / Print Receipt,\nDisplay Cash Dispensed,\nConfirm Cash Dispensed
Printing --> Ejecting : Receipt Printed / Eject
Ejecting --> Terminating : Card Ejected / Display Ejected
Confiscating --> Terminating : Card Confiscated / Display Confiscated
Terminating --> Idle : After (Elapsed Time)\n[Closedown Not Requested]

state WaitingForCustomerChoice <<choice>>
WaitingForCustomerChoice --> ProcessingWithdrawal : Withdrawal Selected / [Withdrawal Selected]
WaitingForCustomerChoice --> Ejecting : Cancel / [Cancel]
ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Card Stolen, Card Expired /\nConfiscate, Update Status
ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Third Invalid PIN /\nConfiscate
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForCustomerChoice : Valid PIN / [Valid PIN]
WaitingForPIN --> Ejecting : Cancel / [Cancel]
WaitingForPIN --> Confiscating : Card Confiscated / display Confiscated
WaitingForPIN --> Confiscating : Card Stolen, Card Expired /\nConfiscate, Update Status
WaitingForPIN --> Confiscating : Third Invalid PIN /\nConfiscate
@enduml
